  "description": "TOTP two-factor authentication for Umbraco members, with single-use backup codes. SECURITY: 3.0.0 fixes an unauthenticated API in 2.x that allowed anyone to disable 2FA or read backup codes for any member; also fixes Base32 secret encoding (2.x emitted Base64, which no authenticator app can enrol) and hashes stored backup codes. Does not gate login on its own - see the readme. Umbraco 13 (net8.0) and 17 (net10.0).",
